{%- comment -%}
  Shoppable collection upgrades. Turned on per collection handle below.
  - Slim header, quick-filter chips (built automatically from the filters), "Start here" staff picks
  - One card per model: width variants merge into Standard / Wide / X-Wide links, colorways become swatches
  - Cleaner card titles, sort menu, filters reordered, "Need help choosing?" block
  To turn on for another collection, add a "when" block. Picks are optional.
  Picks format: family-collection (optional)|label|mens-handle|womens-handle|model name|one-line blurb|extra meta (optional)|unisex (optional) ;; next pick
{%- endcomment -%}
